# The keys qa/.env.local may provide. qa/.env.local is never committed. Every key is optional: a
# variable in the shell wins over qa/.env.local, which wins over the default shown.
#
# Nothing here is a secret yet. From F02 onward the accounts' credentials are listed here by key
# and their values live only in qa/.env.local.

# Where the product under test answers. The defaults follow the product's own settings
# (SALON_API_PORT, SALON_WEB_PORT and SALON_POSTGRES_PORT, from the shell or the root .env).
# QA_API_URL=http://localhost:8090
# QA_WEB_URL=http://localhost:3100

# F02 fixtures generate random credentials in process memory through the local seed hook.
# When the lead keeps runtime scripts/logs in another retained checkout, set its absolute root.
# QA_PRODUCT_ROOT=/absolute/path/to/the/prepared/final/checkout
